    "Register your interest": "登记您的意向",
    "Registration is open. Here is what follows.": "登记现已开放。以下是接下来的流程。",
    "Two minutes now, and the Secretariat comes back to you as each piece is confirmed.": "现在只需两分钟,秘书处将在每项内容确认后与您联系。",
    "Registration of interest is open for the Kenya-China Tea Summit, 21–23 April\n2027 at KICC in Nairobi.": "Kenya-China Tea Summit意向登记现已开放,峰会将于2027年4月21日至23日在Nairobi的KICC举行。",
    "What the form asks": "表格要求填写的内容",
    "Name, email, mobile number with country code, organisation, job title, country\nand category. Everything else is optional.": "姓名、电子邮箱、带国家代码的手机号码、机构、职位、国家和类别。其他内容均为可选项。",
    "There are nine categories, and they describe what an organisation <em>is</em> rather\nthan what it wants: government and institutional delegates, tea producers and\nprocessors, end-user brands, traders and merchants, machinery and packaging\nsuppliers, investors and financial institutions, media, academic and research\ninstitutions, and a general observer category.": "共有九个类别,它们描述的是机构<em>本身</em>而非其需求:政府及机构代表、茶叶生产商和加工商、终端用户品牌、贸易商和经销商、机械和包装供应商、投资者和金融机构、媒体、学术和研究机构,以及普通观察员类别。",
    "Exhibiting and partnering are separate tick-boxes. That separation is\ndeliberate. A tea producer can also want a stand, and the previous single list\nforced people to choose between describing themselves and describing what they\nwere after.": "参展和合作是独立的勾选项。这种分离是刻意设计的。茶叶生产商也可能需要展位,而之前的单一列表迫使人们在描述自身和描述需求之间做出选择。",
    "What happens to it": "信息如何处理",
    "The Secretariat holds your details to contact you about the summit. They are\nshared with official event partners only where registration and logistics\nrequire it, and never sold. To review, correct or delete your information,\nemail <a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>.": "秘书处保留您的详细信息以便就峰会事宜与您联系。仅在登记和后勤需要时与官方活动合作伙伴共享,绝不出售。如需查看、更正或删除您的信息,请发送电子邮件至<a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>。",
    "The delegate portal": "代表门户",
    "The portal opens later this year. Registered delegates sign in with the email\naddress they registered with, and from there update their details, book a stand\nif exhibiting, request B2B meetings and download documents.": "门户将于今年晚些时候开放。已注册代表使用其注册时使用的电子邮件地址登录,在此更新其详细信息、预订展位(如参展)、申请B2B会议并下载文件。",
    "The timetable": "时间表",
    "Registration fees, what each category includes and the registration deadline\nare still being set. So are stand sizes and rates, hotel rates, and the speaker\nprogramme. Each is published here and emailed to registered delegates as it is\nconfirmed.": "注册费用、各类别包含的内容以及注册截止日期仍在制定中。展位尺寸和费率、酒店价格以及演讲嘉宾计划也是如此。每项内容一经确认即在此处发布,并通过电子邮件发送给已注册代表。",
    "Stand booking is the one with a hard deadline attached: exhibitors commit\nearly, so the interactive floor plan is the priority for the portal.": "展位预订是唯一有硬性截止日期的项目:参展商需提前承诺,因此交互式平面图是门户的优先事项。",
